  "title": "Nejedly-2020b-multicenter-10.1038/s41597-020-0532-5",
  "description": "This dataset provides intracranial EEG (stereo-EEG) clips from a multicenter collection for classification of physiological and pathological graphoelements and artifactual signals. It comprises independent 3 s single-channel clips sampled at 5000 Hz, converted to BIDS from the segmented .mat archives released with Nejedly et al. 2020. Events preserve clip labels, anatomy, reviewer identity, seizure onset zone flags, and electrode type.",
  "methods_description": "Independent 3 s single-channel iEEG clips from one subject and one SEEG contact were concatenated at 5000 Hz into each BIDS run. Events mark the clip boundaries and retain the original annotations. Electrode coordinates were not released, so x/y/z are n/a in electrodes.tsv.",
